  "body": "Sit on the balcony and enjoy the ocean view in this quality, light-filled, RENDERED BRICK (not plaster) two-level home that is good to go. Enjoy the best of coastal living in this sunny home, perfectly positioned to make the most of the marina lifestyle and everything the surrounding area has to offer.\r\n\r\n- Beautiful sea views.\r\n- A fantastic location.\r\n- Practical, well-designed layout.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n3 spacious bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms.\r\nDouble garage with built in storage\r\nInternal Vacuum.\r\nSunny, warm and inviting throughout.\r\nHeat pump for year-round comfort.\r\nOpen-plan living.\r\nFully fenced, easy-care garden.\r\nPlenty of storage.\r\nHigh ceilings.\r\nSea views and the relaxed marina lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAn Unbeatable Lifestyle Location\r\n\r\nLive close to the marina, with a fantastic selection of local restaurants, beautiful beaches and outdoor activities right on your doorstep. Enjoy leisurely walks, coastal adventures and the natural beauty of Shakespeare Regional Park, with a golf course also nearby.\r\n\r\nSet within a welcoming, family-friendly community, this location offers something for everyone, whether you love an active outdoor lifestyle or simply want to relax and enjoy the sunshine.\r\n\r\nRetirees, families, investors, first home buyers this home works for everyone!",
